  "body": "Fix the Windows failure in the hierarchical Cargo config test. Build its three expected `.cargo` paths one component at a time, so they use the same native separators as the diagnostic. Keep every assertion and all runtime code unchanged.\n\nBase: `4d891498e7270eabba1b82809d08228b465c0aec`. Head: `0f816e13c8804f226631b73f8ad014bb92be28e1`. The branch starts from canonical main; the fork's main is unchanged.\n\n## Reproduction and checks\n\nThe separate verifier ran `cargo test -j 4 -p xtask unit_env::config::tests::hierarchical_configs_report_paths_and_key_hints_not_effective_values -- --exact --nocapture` on Windows:\n\n- Before: FAIL, 0 passed, 1 failed. The path-count assertion at `config.rs:98` found 0 matches instead of 1.\n- After: PASS, 1 passed, 0 failed. The same test also passes in the quick gate.\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `cargo xtask gate quick --base 4d891498e7270eabba1b82809d08228b465c0aec` | FAIL: one xtask step, 370 passed, 5 failed, 0 ignored; 222 seconds, no stall |\n| `cargo clippy -j 4 -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` | PASS |\n| `cargo xtask gate light --only 'motion light:' --only 'app light:'` | PASS: all 11 tests across five steps, zero failures or stalls, exit 0; 17.7 minutes including cold release builds. Each target compiled; redundant all-target prebuild omitted |\n| `git diff --check` | PASS |\n\nAll five quick-gate failures also occurred on the pristine baseline:\n\n- `unit_env::config::tests::relative_cargo_home_is_resolved_for_each_command_directory` (#4427).\n- `unit_env::config::tests::unrelated_config_keys_do_not_claim_hash_keys` (#4428).\n- `unit_env::tests::plan_notes_only_scan_ui_config_for_ui_steps`.\n- `seed_tests::a_seeded_checkout_finds_a_build_script_dependency_fresh`.\n- `watchdog_tests::a_silent_step_is_killed_as_a_tree_and_named`.\n\nThe broader baseline run was stopped after it recorded these failures. This is not a green quick gate. Linux, macOS, full heavy lanes and the release gate were not exercised. No golden changes.\n\nDecision: `docs/decisions/4426-windows-config-paths.md`.\nWriter record: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/4426#issuecomment-7228356123\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #4426\r\n",
